The probe signal replicates on 73 days - and is already priced

Two questions answered: does the unfilled-probe signal survive outside the two
live days, and can it be used defensively to avoid losses rather than to buy.

1. THE SIGNAL REPLICATES. This is the first result in this project to do so.

paths_full.parquet has no record of our own orders, so a fill proxy was built
(the favourite's bid falls to or below our resting price) and VALIDATED
against the 303 orders where the real fill outcome is known before being used.

  wait 120s   population 8,201 mkts / 73 days   gap +21.0pp  CI [+18.2,+23.4]
              303 live orders, REAL fills       gap +21.6pp
  wait  60s   population                        gap +16.2pp  CI [+13.7,+18.7]
              303 live orders, REAL fills       gap +17.9pp
              P(<=0) = 0.0000 on both

Real fills and modelled fills agree to within 0.6pp on independent samples.
An unfilled probe genuinely predicts a winner.

2. IT IS ALREADY PRICED. Buying the no-fill branch at the displayed ask:

  wait 120s  1,174 commitable markets  taker edge +0.82c  P(<=0) 0.2607
  wait  60s  2,453 commitable markets  taker edge -0.52c  P(<=0) 0.7047

The unfilled cohort is worth +15.35c at the BID and +0.82c at the ASK. The
spread is the entire edge - roughly 6-7c to cross against a signal worth
roughly 6-7c.

3. THE DEFENSIVE USE DOES NOT WORK EITHER, AND A CLAIM IS WITHDRAWN.

An intermediate calculation reported that capping the filled cohort at q1
saves $54.61/day. That was an artifact of the proxy and is WITHDRAWN. The
proxy only calls a fill when the bid visibly fell, so its "filled" bucket is
the worst 25% rather than the real 89%:

  filled-cohort maker edge   REAL +0.08c   PROXY -5.55c
  fill rate                  REAL 0.8911   PROXY 0.6253

On real exchange fills the filled cohort is +0.08c - break-even, not a loss.
There is nothing to avoid. What looks like a loss is an opportunity cost: a
+21.70c cohort exists and is systematically not owned.

CONSEQUENCE FOR PTC. All three doors close for the same reason. Buying the
signal nets +0.82c; avoiding it saves nothing because the owned cohort is
already break-even; and holding it at the bid is impossible by definition.
The exchange's ask already contains the information the probe reveals.

This does not overturn the PTC FAIL verdict - it explains it. PTC's mechanism
is real and now replicated at n=8,201, and its dollar value is ~zero because
the market prices the same information.

Adds research/probe_signal_population.py, research/ptc_show_me_the_money.py
and data/probe_signal_population.parquet.

